 'Instagram disabled, no appeal button.','The notice shows no appeal button, or the button disappeared. What that usually means and what is still possible.',
 '<strong>No appeal button usually means one of three things:</strong> the appeal was already used, the time to appeal has passed, or the notice says the decision is final. Check whether you can still log in to see Account Status, use the hacked page if anyone changed your details, and in the EU look at out-of-court dispute bodies. Meta makes the final decision.',
