     f'<strong>The Meta appeal routes in {cn} are the same as everywhere else:</strong> appeal from the notice at login, use instagram.com/hacked or facebook.com/hacked for takeovers, and Business Support Home for ad accounts. Meta has no general phone line. Local bodies record fraud and hacking but do not restore accounts. Meta makes the final decision.',
     [('Same routes','In-app notice, hacked pages, Business Support Home.'),('Local reporting','For hacking and money lost.'),('No phone line','Meta has no support number.')],
     '<h2 id="which-link">Which link do you need?</h2><ul><li>Disabled or suspended: '+L('guides/facebook-account-disabled-appeal','Facebook appeal')+' or '+L('guides/instagram-account-suspended-appeal','Instagram appeal')+'.</li><li>Other countries: '+L('meta-appeal-links-usa','USA')+', '+L('meta-appeal-links-uk','UK')+', '+L('meta-appeal-links-canada','Canada')+'.</li></ul>',
